%% Sequence flow for a complex tribulation episode
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant XM as Xuanzang
    participant SWK as Sun Wukong
    participant ZBJ as Zhu Bajie
    participant SWJ as Sha Wujing
    participant DEM as Demon Envoy
    participant GY as Guanyin Envoy
    participant ALL as Full Convoy

    Note over XM,DEM: English-major narrative; Chinese hints used only as auxiliary notes

    DEM->>XM: Present forged treaty and invite convoy to neutral zone
    XM->>SWK: Request identity and seal verification before entry
    SWK->>DEM: Request witness token and domain signature
    DEM-->>SWK: Returns inconsistent credentials

    SWK->>ZBJ: Prepare flank disruption protocol
    ZBJ->>SWJ: Protect scripture chest and rear lane

    DEM->>XM: Trigger illusion and isolate monk
    SWJ->>XM: Maintain mantra anchor and visual continuity
    SWK->>DEM: Break illusion layer with staff sweep
    DEM-->>SWK: Deploy clone phantoms and false hostages

    alt Risk is extreme
        XM->>GY: Petition mediation with civilian-safety priority
        GY-->>DEM: Enforce surrender under celestial witness
    else Risk manageable
        SWK->>ZBJ: Execute pincer extraction path
        ZBJ->>DEM: Break formation command node
    end

    SWK->>XM: Report route reopened and threat contained
    XM->>ALL: Continue pilgrimage with updated branch choice
    Note over XM,SWK: 辅助注释：先证据后开战
